iption":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708059,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4MDU5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:2d","name":"topic:2d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-02-07T01:12:47Z","updated_at":"2025-02-07T18:31:26Z","closed_at":"2025-02-07T12:43:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102508","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102508","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102508.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102508.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Introduce new properties for dashed/dotted patterns:\n  - `dashed` (bool): Enables or disables dashed rendering.\n  - `dash_length` (float): Specifies the length of each dash.\n  - `gap_length` (float): Specifies the gap between dashes.\n  \n- Implement a helper method `_compute_dashed_segments()` that processes the original polyline into segments based on the dash and gap lengths.\n  \n- Update the `_draw()` method to:\n  - Check for the `dashed` flag.\n  - Use the new helper function to generate dash segments.\n  - Build and combine geometry for each dash segment.\n  \n- Bind the new properties in `_bind_methods()` so that they are exposed to the scripting API and editor.\n  \n- Ensure that the non-dashed mode continues to function as before.\n\nThis commit adds flexible support for dashed/dotted line rendering, improving the visual customization of the Line2D node.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Zaid-mohamed","id":119681133,"node_id":"U_kgDOByIwbQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119681133?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed","html_url":"https://github.com/Zaid-mohamed","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-mohamed/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102508/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102508/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}